      "entry_name": "c007_memoryregionarray_push",
      "receiver_type": "MemoryRegionArray",
      "expect": "supported",
      "expect_source": "recipe-override",
      "expect_basis": "K007（memory-region-push-test）：push 的 ensures 在 `old(self)@.len() < LEN` 时给出 `final(self)@ == old(self)@.push(region)` 且 `ret.is_ok()`；4 次前置 push 后 len=4<64，第 5 次 push 的成功与后状态长度 5 均可由契约字面推出。",
      "obligation": "let mut recv = MemoryRegionArray::<64>::new();\nlet _ = recv.push(MemoryRegion::new(0usize, 4097usize, MemoryRegionType::Usable)).unwrap();\nlet _ = recv.push(MemoryRegion::new(4095usize, 4098usize, MemoryRegionType::Usable)).unwrap();\nlet _ = recv.push(MemoryRegion::new(8192usize, 20480usize, MemoryRegionType::Usable)).unwrap();\nlet _ = recv.push(MemoryRegion::new(12289usize, 4094usize, MemoryRegionType::BadMemory)).unwrap();\nlet out = recv.push(MemoryRegion::new(36864usize, 8192usize, MemoryRegionType::Usable));\nlet flag = out.is_ok();\nassert(flag && recv@.len() == 5usize);",
      "obligation_draft": "assert_eq!(regions.count, 5)\nassert_eq!(regions[0].base(), 0)\nassert_eq!(regions[0].len(), PAGE_SIZE * 3)\nassert_eq!(regions[0].typ(), MemoryRegionType::Usable)\nregions .push(MemoryRegion::new( 0, PAGE_SIZE + 1, MemoryRegionType::Usable, )) .unwrap();\nregions .push(MemoryRegion::new( PAGE_SIZE - 1, PAGE_SIZE + 2, MemoryRegionType::Usable, )) .unwrap();\nregions .push(MemoryRegion::new( PAGE_SIZE * 2, PAGE_SIZE * 5, MemoryRegionType::Usable, )) .unwrap();\nregions .push(MemoryRegion::new( PAGE_SIZE * 3 + 1, PAGE_SIZE - 2, MemoryRegionType::BadMemory, )) .unwrap();"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "K131",
      "function": "Mutex::try_lock",
      "family": "is_none-demand",
      "constructibility": "constructible",
      "registry_overlap": "none",
      "dedup_key": "ktest:K131",
      "entry_name": "c131_mutex_try_lock",
      "receiver_type": "Mutex",
      "expect": "gap",
      "expect_source": "recipe-override",
      "expect_basis": "K131（mutex-try-lock-demand）：try_lock 的 ensures 只有 `ret is Some ==> ret->0.rel_mutex(*self)`，不约束返回 None；持有 lock() 的 guard 时不释放、返回 None 是运行时/文档事实，契约不表达。",
      "obligation": "let recv = Mutex::<u64>::new(0u64);\nlet _guard = recv.lock();\nlet out = recv.try_lock();\nlet flag = out.is_none();\nassert(flag);",
      "obligation_draft": "assert!(lock.try_lock().is_none())"
    }
